import{a as e,i as t,n,o as r,r as i,s as a}from"./GuidePage-BNb_i_dh.js";var o=[{label:`Vercel Analytics Privacy Policy`,url:`https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/privacy-policy`},{label:`Google Privacy Policy`,url:`https://policies.google.com/privacy`},{label:`Google AdSense: certified CMP requirements`,url:`https://support.google.com/adsense/answer/13554116`}],s={"zh-TW":{title:`關於 HandFuture`,summary:`HandFuture 是探索手相文化的獨立網頁專案，以有來源的入門文章和透明的瀏覽器內互動功能，區分文化傳統、技術能力與科學證據。`,updatedAt:`2026-07-26`,sections:[{heading:`這個專案`,paragraphs:[`HandFuture 是一個探索手相文化的獨立網頁專案。網站把傳統名稱與歷史敘事放回文化脈絡中介紹，並清楚標示這些內容不等於科學驗證。`,`HandFuture 是本網站的發布者。頁面所列日期是內容實際檢視與更新的日期，而不是組織規模、業績或專業資格的表示。`]},{heading:`提供的內容`,paragraphs:[`網站提供附有參考來源的手相文化入門指南，也提供瀏覽器內的手部關節偵測器。偵測器定位一般手部關節後，會從固定題庫選出一張一般性的反思卡。`,`反思卡用於文化娛樂與自我對話。選卡所用的手部幾何資訊只是穩定的程式輸入，不是掌紋解讀，也不是對照片中人物的衡量。`]},{heading:`不主張的事項`,paragraphs:[`HandFuture 不提供科學手相判讀、人格評估、診斷、預測或專業諮詢，也不把手部關節座標說成能揭露健康、能力、關係或未來。`,`目前的功能使用一般手部關節偵測技術；HandFuture 不宣稱擁有獨家掌部影像收藏、獨家訓練方法或能解讀掌褶的自有技術。`]},{heading:`編輯原則`,paragraphs:[`內容會區分傳統說法與可驗證證據，盡可能連結可查閱的來源，並揭露偵測與解讀的限制。歷史資料也會依其年代與脈絡閱讀，不把單一說法描述成跨文化共識。`,`若發現會實質影響讀者理解的錯誤，內容將予以更正。每個編輯頁面會顯示實際更新日期，讓讀者判斷資料的新舊。`]}],sources:[]},en:{title:`About HandFuture`,summary:`HandFuture is an independent web project for exploring palmistry culture through sourced introductory articles and a transparent in-browser interactive feature that separates tradition, technical capability, and scientific evidence.`,updatedAt:`2026-07-26`,sections:[{heading:`This project`,paragraphs:[`HandFuture is an independent web project for exploring palmistry culture. It places traditional names and historical narratives in cultural context and clearly distinguishes them from scientifically validated claims.`,`HandFuture publishes this site. Dates shown on editorial pages record when the material was actually reviewed and updated; they do not represent organizational scale, commercial results, or professional credentials.`]},{heading:`What it provides`,paragraphs:[`The site provides sourced introductory guides to palmistry culture and an in-browser hand-joint detector. After locating general hand landmarks, the detector selects one general reflection card from a fixed set.`,`A reflection card is for cultural entertainment and personal reflection. The hand geometry used to select it is only a stable program input, not a palm reading or measurement of the person in the photo.`]},{heading:`What it does not claim`,paragraphs:[`HandFuture does not provide scientific palm reading, personality assessment, diagnosis, prediction, or expert consultation. It does not present hand-joint coordinates as evidence about health, ability, relationships, or future events.`,`The current feature uses general hand-joint detection technology. HandFuture makes no claim to an exclusive palm-image collection, exclusive training method, or self-developed technology that can interpret palm creases.`]},{heading:`Editorial principles`,paragraphs:[`Content distinguishes traditional accounts from verifiable evidence, links to accessible sources where possible, and discloses limits in detection and interpretation. Historical material is read in the context of its period rather than described as a cross-cultural consensus.`,`Material errors that affect a reader's understanding will be corrected. Each editorial page displays its actual update date so readers can judge how current the information is.`]}],sources:[]},"zh-CN":n.about,ja:e.about,ko:t.about,es:a.about,"pt-BR":i.about,fr:r.about},c={"zh-TW":{title:`隱私政策`,summary:`本政策說明 HandFuture 網站目前如何處理手部影像、外部資源請求、瀏覽器儲存、網站傳遞、整體分析、Google 廣告與區域同意選項。政策生效及更新日期為 2026-07-26。`,updatedAt:`2026-07-26`,sections:[{heading:`適用範圍與日期`,paragraphs:[`本政策適用於 HandFuture 的公開網站及其瀏覽器內互動功能。生效日期與最近更新日期均為 2026-07-26。`,`以下內容描述目前可由網站程式與部署設定確認的資料流。第三方服務會依各自政策處理其收到的資料。`]},{heading:`手部影像`,paragraphs:[`只有在訪客自行選擇檔案後，瀏覽器才會用 FileReader 讀取影像。瀏覽器接著將影像解碼為記憶體中的 HTMLImageElement，並直接交給在裝置端執行的 MediaPipe 手部偵測器，用於手部關節偵測及預覽，過程中沒有任何中介繪製步驟。影像不會傳送至 HandFuture 的應用程式伺服器。`,`選取的影像、解碼後的 HTMLImageElement、關節座標與反思卡保留在目前頁面的記憶體中，不會由 HandFuture 寫入瀏覽器持久儲存。按下重設、重新整理頁面、關閉分頁或瀏覽器的記憶體管理都會移除這些記憶體狀態。`]},{heading:`外部資源請求`,paragraphs:[`訪客選擇手部影像後，瀏覽器會從 cdn.jsdelivr.net 這個內容傳遞網路載入 MediaPipe 手部偵測所需的模型檔案。網站在每次載入頁面時，也會從 fonts.googleapis.com 與 fonts.gstatic.com 載入 Google Fonts 字型檔案。`,`這些請求只會取得模型與字型檔案。如同任何網路請求，它們可能讓 cdn.jsdelivr.net、fonts.googleapis.com 與 fonts.gstatic.com 這些提供者取得一般的請求中繼資料，例如訪客的 IP 位址與瀏覽器 user agent。這些請求不包含所選的手部影像、關節座標，也不含任何 HandFuture 自建的遙測資料。`]},{heading:`瀏覽器儲存`,paragraphs:[`網站在本機儲存空間只寫入三個鍵，全部是介面偏好：palm-reading-storage 只保存免責聲明接受狀態；language-store 保存語言偏好；palm-theme 保存主題偏好。這些鍵不保存手部照片、解碼後的影像元素或關節座標。`,`訪客可透過瀏覽器的網站資料或隱私設定，查看並清除 handfortune.com 名下的所有本機儲存資料。清除後，相關偏好會回到預設值，網站之後可能再次顯示免責聲明。`]},{heading:`語言建議`,paragraphs:[`為了在未含語言前綴的首頁提供語言建議，HandFuture 會依序查看已儲存的語言偏好與瀏覽器回報的語言清單。只有兩者都沒有支援的語言時，才會向同源的 Vercel 端點請求由連線 IP 推導的兩字母國家代碼；網址中已指定語言時不會進行這項判斷。`,`這項功能不會取得或儲存完整 IP 位址，也不會建立位置檔案。Vercel 可能依其主機服務與政策處理產生國家代碼所需的請求資料；端點只向 HandFuture 頁面回傳國家代碼或空值，不回傳城市或更精確的位置。`]},{heading:`Vercel 主機與分析`,paragraphs:[`Vercel 提供網站主機託管。網站內容的傳遞記錄由主機供應商依其服務與政策處理；Vercel Web Analytics 提供整體使用分析。HandFuture 傳送的分析事件不包含手部照片。`,`Vercel 如何設計 Web Analytics 與處理相關資料，請參閱下方的 Vercel Analytics 隱私說明。`]},{heading:`Google 廣告`,paragraphs:[`網站包含 Google AdSense 的廣告程式碼。該程式可能向 Google 請求網路資源，並依訪客的同意狀態及 Google 政策使用 Cookie 或其他瀏覽器儲存。實際顯示的廣告與可用控制也受 Google 的服務狀態影響。`,`使用廣告阻擋工具或網站尚未獲得廣告核准，不會限制訪客閱讀 HandFuture 的內容或使用本機互動功能。Google 對其服務資料的處理方式請參閱下方的 Google 隱私權政策。`]},{heading:`區域同意`,paragraphs:[`在 Google 要求同意管理的地區提供個人化或非個人化廣告前，將先在 AdSense 的「隱私權與訊息」中啟用 Google 認證的同意管理平台（CMP）。在完成設定前，不將 CMP 描述為目前已運作的功能。`,`Google 對發布者使用認證 CMP 的要求可由下方官方說明查閱。訪客看到同意控制時，可以使用該介面選擇或調整可用選項。`]},{heading:`Cloudflare DNS`,paragraphs:[`在目前設定中，Cloudflare 僅提供權威 DNS。它不是 HandFuture 目前的內容代理，也不是提供網站內容的主機；網站內容由 Vercel 傳遞。`]},{heading:`選擇與權利`,paragraphs:[`訪客可以不選擇手部照片、清除網站資料、使用瀏覽器的 Cookie 與儲存控制，並在畫面提供同意控制時調整選項。停用部分瀏覽器功能可能重設偏好或影響第三方廣告，但文章內容仍可閱讀。`,`關於供應商資料處理或其提供的選項，請直接查閱下方 Vercel 與 Google 的官方政策。任何依法適用的權利仍以相關法律及實際資料處理者提供的程序為準。`]},{heading:`聯絡方式`,paragraphs:[`隱私政策聯絡地址為 privacy@handfortune.com。此信箱僅在網域郵件轉寄啟用後使用。可正常運作的 Cloudflare Email Routing 是發布前提；在完成路由與實際收信測試前，不應把此地址視為現有的聯絡管道。`]}],sources:o},en:{title:`Privacy Policy`,summary:`This policy explains how the current HandFuture website handles hand images, external resource requests, browser storage, site delivery, aggregate analytics, Google advertising, and regional consent choices. It is effective and updated on 2026-07-26.`,updatedAt:`2026-07-26`,sections:[{heading:`Scope and date`,paragraphs:[`This policy applies to the public HandFuture website and its in-browser interactive feature. Its effective date and latest update date are both 2026-07-26.`,`The disclosures below describe data flows that can currently be confirmed from the site code and deployment configuration. Third-party services process the data they receive under their own policies.`]},{heading:`Hand images`,paragraphs:[`Only after a visitor chooses a file does browser FileReader read the image. The browser then decodes it into an in-memory HTMLImageElement, which is passed directly to the on-device MediaPipe hand detector for hand-joint detection and preview, with no intermediate drawing step. The image is not sent to a HandFuture application server.`,`The selected image, the decoded HTMLImageElement, landmark coordinates, and reflection card stay in current page memory and are not written by HandFuture to persistent browser storage. Reset, refresh, tab close, or browser memory management removes these in-memory states.`]},{heading:`External resource requests`,paragraphs:[`After a visitor selects a hand image, the browser loads the MediaPipe hand-detection model files from the cdn.jsdelivr.net content delivery network. On every page load, the site also loads Google Fonts font files from fonts.googleapis.com and fonts.gstatic.com.`,`These requests fetch model and font assets only. Like any web request, they can expose ordinary request metadata such as the visitor's IP address and browser user agent to cdn.jsdelivr.net, fonts.googleapis.com, and fonts.gstatic.com. They do not include the selected hand image, landmark coordinates, or any HandFuture-specific telemetry.`]},{heading:`Browser storage`,paragraphs:[`The site writes only three local-storage keys, all of them interface preferences: palm-reading-storage stores disclaimer acceptance only; language-store stores the language preference; and palm-theme stores the theme preference. These keys do not store the hand photo, the decoded image element, or landmark coordinates.`,`Visitors can inspect and clear everything stored locally for handfortune.com through their browser's site-data or privacy settings. Clearing it resets the related preferences, and the site may show the disclaimer again on a later visit.`]},{heading:`Language suggestion`,paragraphs:[`To suggest a language on the unprefixed home page, HandFuture checks the saved language preference first and then the browser languages. Only when neither identifies a supported language does the page request a two-letter, IP-derived country code from a same-origin Vercel endpoint; a URL that already names a locale bypasses this process.`,`This feature does not obtain or store the full IP address and does not create a location profile. Vercel may process request data needed to derive the country code under its hosting service and policies; the endpoint returns only the country code or null to the HandFuture page, never a city or more precise location.`]},{heading:`Vercel hosting and analytics`,paragraphs:[`Vercel provides hosting. Delivery logs for site content are handled by the hosting provider under its service and policies, and aggregate Vercel Web Analytics reports site usage. HandFuture analytics events do not include the palm image.`,`See the linked Vercel Analytics privacy documentation below for how Vercel designs Web Analytics and handles related data.`]},{heading:`Google advertising`,paragraphs:[`The site includes Google AdSense advertising code. That script may request network resources from Google and use cookies or other browser storage according to the visitor's consent state and Google policy. Ad display and available controls also depend on Google's service state.`,`Using an ad blocker, or the site not being approved to show ads, does not restrict access to HandFuture content or its local interactive feature. See the linked Google Privacy Policy for Google's handling of service data.`]},{heading:`Regional consent`,paragraphs:[`Before personalized or non-personalized ads are served where Google requires consent management, a Google-certified CMP will be enabled through AdSense Privacy & messaging. Until that setup is complete, the CMP is not described as a currently operating feature.`,`Google's requirement for publishers to use a certified CMP is linked below. When consent controls are presented, visitors can use that interface to select or adjust the available choices.`]},{heading:`Cloudflare DNS`,paragraphs:[`In the current configuration, Cloudflare provides authoritative DNS only. It is not the active HandFuture content proxy or host; Vercel delivers the site content.`]},{heading:`Choices and rights`,paragraphs:[`Visitors can decline to select a hand image, clear site data, use browser cookie and storage controls, and adjust choices when a consent interface is presented. Disabling some browser features may reset preferences or affect third-party advertising, but the articles remain accessible.`,`For provider processing and provider-specific choices, consult the official Vercel and Google policies linked below. Any rights that apply by law remain subject to applicable law and the procedures offered by the party that actually processes the data.`]},{heading:`Contact`,paragraphs:[`The privacy-policy address is privacy@handfortune.com. This address is monitored only after domain email routing is enabled. Working Cloudflare Email Routing is a release prerequisite; until routing and real delivery are tested, the address should not be treated as a current contact channel.`]}],sources:o},"zh-CN":n.privacy,ja:e.privacy,ko:t.privacy,es:a.privacy,"pt-BR":i.privacy,fr:r.privacy},l={"zh-TW":{title:`使用條款`,summary:`本條款說明 HandFuture 的文化娛樂用途、訪客責任、內容權利、服務限制與適用法律。使用網站前請先閱讀這些界線。`,updatedAt:`2026-07-26`,sections:[{heading:`接受條款與服務說明`,paragraphs:[`造訪或使用 HandFuture，即表示訪客同意遵守本條款及適用法律；不同意時請停止使用網站。HandFuture 提供有來源的手相文化文章，以及在目前瀏覽器頁面執行的手部關節偵測與一般反思卡。`,`此服務不建立帳號、專業人士與客戶、醫療服務或信託關係。網站上的文化材料與互動結果均受下列娛樂用途限制。`]},{heading:`僅供娛樂`,paragraphs:[`手相文章、手部關節偵測與反思卡僅供文化娛樂與一般自我反思，不是對個人的事實評估，也不提供醫療、心理健康、法律、財務、就業、關係、相容性或未來方面的建議。`,`請勿依賴網站內容作出健康、安全、權利、金錢、工作或人際關係等重大決定。需要具後果性的判斷時，應使用可靠資訊，並在適當時尋求合格專業人士協助。`]},{heading:`年齡指引`,paragraphs:[`未達所在地成年年齡的訪客，應在家長或監護人的陪同與指導下使用網站。不同地區的成年規則可能不同，本條款不宣稱存在適用所有訪客的單一年齡門檻。`]},{heading:`可接受的使用方式`,paragraphs:[`不得利用網站從事違法、侵權、欺騙、騷擾或濫用行為，也不得干擾網站、規避安全限制、引入惡意程式，或嘗試未經授權存取相關系統。`,`不得產生自動化流量、以爬取行為造成服務過載、操弄廣告曝光或點擊，或以其他方式干擾廣告與網站的正常運作。合理閱讀公開內容不受此限制。`]},{heading:`使用者影像`,paragraphs:[`訪客必須有權使用自行選擇的影像，並應避免讓臉孔、證件或其他第三人的可識別內容入鏡。不得選擇侵犯隱私、著作權或其他權利的影像。`,`HandFuture 不主張擁有在本機選取之照片的所有權。選檔只讓目前的瀏覽器頁面處理影像，不代表向 HandFuture 移轉照片權利或授予公開使用權。`]},{heading:`智慧財產與授權`,paragraphs:[`除另有標示外，網站程式、HandFuture 品牌與編輯內容受智慧財產規則保護。訪客僅可為正常瀏覽與個人使用而存取網站，不因此取得所有權。`,`第三方與開放原始碼元件仍受各自授權條款約束；引用來源的內容與權利仍屬原權利人。網站中的連結或引用不表示 HandFuture 擁有第三方材料。`]},{heading:`可用性與變更`,paragraphs:[`功能、內容與網址可能因維護、技術限制或編輯需要而變更、暫停或停止。HandFuture 不保證特定功能永遠存在，也不保證任何正常運作時間、回覆時間或不中斷服務。`,`條款如有重要變更，更新版本會顯示新的日期。變更後繼續使用網站，即表示訪客接受當時顯示的條款。`]},{heading:`免責聲明與責任限制`,paragraphs:[`在適用法律允許的範圍內，網站依現況提供，不對文化解讀、偵測結果、完整性、適用性或可用性作保證。訪客仍須對如何理解與使用內容負責。`,`在適用法律允許的範圍內，HandFuture 對因使用或無法使用網站所生的間接、附帶或後果性損失不承擔責任。任何不能依法排除或限制的責任，不受本條限制。`]},{heading:`聯絡方式`,paragraphs:[`關於網站資料處理與可用聯絡管道，請查看隱私政策。聯絡方式是否可用，依隱私政策所列的發布前提而定；本條款不另列未驗證的信箱。`]}],sources:[{label:`隱私政策`,url:`/privacy`}]},en:{title:`Terms of Use`,summary:`These terms explain HandFuture's cultural-entertainment scope, visitor responsibilities, content rights, service limitations, and applicable law. Read these boundaries before using the site.`,updatedAt:`2026-07-26`,sections:[{heading:`Acceptance and service description`,paragraphs:[`By visiting or using HandFuture, a visitor agrees to follow these terms and applicable law. If you do not agree, stop using the site. HandFuture provides sourced articles about palmistry culture plus hand-joint detection and general reflection cards that run in the current browser page.`,`The service does not create an account relationship, professional-client relationship, medical service, or fiduciary relationship. All cultural material and interactive results remain subject to the entertainment boundary below.`]},{heading:`Entertainment only`,paragraphs:[`Palmistry articles, hand-joint detection, and reflection cards are only for cultural entertainment and general self-reflection. They are not factual assessments of a person and do not provide medical, mental-health, legal, financial, employment, relationship, compatibility, or future advice.`,`Do not rely on site content for consequential decisions involving health, safety, rights, money, work, or relationships. Use reliable information and, when appropriate, seek a qualified professional for decisions that require expertise.`]},{heading:`Age guidance`,paragraphs:[`Visitors under the age of majority where they live should use the site with a parent or guardian. Majority rules differ by location, and these terms do not claim a single age threshold for every visitor.`]},{heading:`Acceptable use`,paragraphs:[`Do not use the site for unlawful, infringing, deceptive, harassing, or abusive conduct. Do not interfere with the site, evade security restrictions, introduce malicious code, or attempt unauthorized access to related systems.`,`Do not generate automated traffic, scrape in a way that overloads the service, engage in ad manipulation involving impressions or clicks, or otherwise disrupt normal advertising or site operation. Reasonable reading of public content is not restricted by this clause.`]},{heading:`User images`,paragraphs:[`Visitors must have the right to use each image they select and should keep faces, documents, and other identifying third-party content out of the frame. Do not select an image that infringes privacy, copyright, or other rights.`,`HandFuture does not claim ownership of locally selected photos. Choosing a file only lets the current browser page process it; it does not transfer photo rights to HandFuture or grant permission for public use.`]},{heading:`Intellectual property and licenses`,paragraphs:[`Unless marked otherwise, site code, the HandFuture brand, and editorial content remain protected under intellectual-property rules. Visitors may access them for ordinary browsing and personal use but do not acquire ownership through that access.`,`Third-party and open-source components remain subject to their own licenses, and rights in cited-source material stay with their respective owners. A link or citation does not mean HandFuture owns third-party material.`]},{heading:`Availability and changes`,paragraphs:[`Features, content, and URLs may change, pause, or stop because of maintenance, technical limits, or editorial needs. HandFuture does not promise that a particular feature will remain available and makes no uptime guarantee, response-time guarantee, or promise of uninterrupted service.`,`When these terms change materially, the updated version will display a new date. Continuing to use the site after a change means accepting the terms then displayed.`]},{heading:`Disclaimer and limitation of liability`,paragraphs:[`To the extent permitted by applicable law, the site is provided as available without warranties about cultural interpretations, detection results, completeness, suitability, or availability. Visitors remain responsible for how they understand and use the content.`,`To the extent permitted by applicable law, HandFuture is not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential loss arising from use of, or inability to use, the site. This limitation does not exclude or limit liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited.`]},{heading:`Contact`,paragraphs:[`For site-data handling and any available contact channel, see the Privacy Policy. Contact availability depends on the release prerequisite stated there; these terms do not list a separate unverified mailbox.`]}],sources:[{label:`Privacy Policy`,url:`/privacy`}]},"zh-CN":n.terms,ja:e.terms,ko:t.terms,es:a.terms,"pt-BR":i.terms,fr:r.terms};export{c as n,l as r,s as t};